    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "how can it pass though? the money is gone, the house is gone, and my reputation is basically dead. people aren't going to see me \"recover,\" they're just going to remember me as the guy who lost everything. there is no coming back from this kind of humiliation. it just feels like the only thing left to do is wait for the impact.",
