      "content": "but building a new foundation is just... it's so much work and for what? to just live in the wreckage? everything i was is gone. i used to have respect, i used to have weight in the world. now i'm just this pathetic person everyone pities or laughs at. i don't want to \"heal\" into someone who is just a shadow of who i was. i just wish i could control the narrative before the bottom hits and i'm just a joke.",
